{"3103290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breaching Harkon", "steam_appid": 3103290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breaching Harkon</strong> is a fast-paced top-down <strong>Roguelike</strong> shooter with crisp pixel art and modern gunplay. Build <strong>BROKEN</strong> weapon combos, outmaneuver deadly enemies, and use your <strong>riot shield</strong> to stay alive when things get too heated.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons &amp; Attachments</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>65+ powerful upgrades</strong> to supercharge your run. From simple reload speed buffs to shooting actual lasers out of your gun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialist vendors</strong> appear randomly, each with <strong>legendary</strong> gear and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The<strong> Bartender</strong> can be unlocked, providing the player with temporary benefits like: <strong>INFINITE AMMO.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/ce9636436be07c9038e10d8349d19c53.poster.avif?t=1772730019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/ce9636436be07c9038e10d8349d19c53.webm?t=1772730019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/ce9636436be07c9038e10d8349d19c53.mp4?t=1772730019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>5 dangerous areas</strong>! From <strong>smuggling yards</strong> and <strong>gambling dens</strong> to <strong>moving trains</strong>. Each location contains unique enemies, hazards, and bosses. Levels are semi-randomized, with handcrafted rooms arranged differently every run for endless replayability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/51101f61d6235f0f2296974e55a416e0.poster.avif?t=1772730019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/51101f61d6235f0f2296974e55a416e0.webm?t=1772730019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/51101f61d6235f0f2296974e55a416e0.mp4?t=1772730019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victor Harkon</strong> rules the state through <strong>wealth</strong>, <strong>machines</strong>, and <strong>ruthless force</strong>, but when he kidnaps your daughter, the war becomes personal. You join forces with a rival <strong>Private Military Company</strong> and begin tearing down his empire piece by piece, floor by floor, until nothing stands between you and the man who stole her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/ab847a4bb2ba56e8dc4442c1e95a4191.poster.avif?t=1772730019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/ab847a4bb2ba56e8dc4442c1e95a4191.webm?t=1772730019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/ab847a4bb2ba56e8dc4442c1e95a4191.mp4?t=1772730019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breac